 ('Woke up', 'Stops the timer and shows the length. Start and end can be nudged.', S(hdr('Tuesday 10 November', 'Ollie and Bea'), today_rows, over=sheet('Ollie slept 1 h 12 min', field('Fell asleep', '8:59 am'), field('Woke up', '10:11 am'), seg(['Nap', 'Night']), field('Note', 'Add'), btn('Done')))),
